<title>USA: Prudential Va. bid rejected, Morgan Stanley wins.</title>
<headline>Prudential Va. bid rejected, Morgan Stanley wins.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Virginia Public School Authority said Thursday a bid submitted by Prudential Securities Inc. on a $92 million bond deal did not conform to bid specifications. The deal was awarded to Morgan Stanley &amp; Co. at a 5.4901 percent true interest cost the agency said.</p>
